*% 36 mm wide) print the page length exactly.
*% Label pages are LANDSCAPE: width = label length (feed), height = tape width.
*% The top and bottom 2 mm (28 dots) of the 36 mm tape cannot be printed (band is 454 dots).
*% Only TZe 36 mm is verified on the PT-E850TKW; other tape widths are added once verified.
